// Psexec Execution | T1021, T1569 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_sysinternals_psexec_execution.yml
Image:*\\psexec.exe OR OriginalFileName:psexec.c

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "Image:*\\\\psexec.exe OR OriginalFileName:psexec.c",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
